{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the <strong>lord and commander of your town</strong>, you'll need to <strong>defend it from swarming enemies</strong>, <strong>upgrade buildings</strong>, and <strong>train soldiers</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with <strong>NPCs within your town to trigger events</strong>, <strong>acquire various heroes</strong>, and ultimately <strong>achieve the grand feat of unifying the continent</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even when idle, you can continuously acquire resources by defending against enemies and mining. These resources can be used to produce soldiers or upgrade buildings, gradually building a stronger town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in <strong>battle waves</strong> and <strong>various limited-time events</strong>, then <strong>conquer the world map</strong> by <strong>occupying other towns</strong> and <strong>training more soldiers</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge event stages</strong> across <strong>different worldviews</strong>, <strong>collect heroes</strong>, and become the <strong>strongest lord and commander</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a path of conquest</strong>, <strong>unify all factions in the world</strong>, and <strong>achieve ultimate supremacy</strong>!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4082780?t=1760735303","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4082780?t=1760735303","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082780/f127fb2d3bd58aafada927a443b9ff5e4e66aee7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760735303","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082780/f127fb2d3bd58aafada927a443b9ff5e4e66aee7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760735303","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the <strong>lord and commander of your town</strong>, you'll need to <strong>defend it from swarming enemies</strong>, <strong>upgrade buildings</strong>, and <strong>train soldiers</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with <strong>NPCs within your town to trigger events</strong>, <strong>acquire various heroes</strong>, and ultimately <strong>achieve the grand feat of unifying the continent</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even when idle, you can continuously acquire resources by defending against enemies and mining. These resources can be used to produce soldiers or upgrade buildings, gradually building a stronger town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in <strong>battle waves</strong> and <strong>various limited-time events</strong>, then <strong>conquer the world map</strong> by <strong>occupying other towns</strong> and <strong>training more soldiers</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge event stages</strong> across <strong>different worldviews</strong>, <strong>collect heroes</strong>, and become the <strong>strongest lord and commander</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a path of conquest</strong>, <strong>unify all factions in the world</strong>, and <strong>achieve ultimate supremacy</strong>!</p>","developers":["NearDream"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3897130","name":"Castle Hearts"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}